{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_209_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"一、二十有八年，春，王三月，葬曹悼公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_209_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"二、公如晉，次於乾侯。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_209_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"公在外也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_209_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，丙戌，鄭伯寧卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_209_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"四、六月，葬鄭定公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_209_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，癸巳，滕子寧卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_209_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_209","textTraditional":"六、冬，葬滕悼公。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}